    &gt;themactep/thingino-firmware&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;thingino&#34;&gt;Thingino
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thingino is an open-source firmware for Ingenic SoC IP cameras.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fe68e13-eb49-4c33-8836-af1e97bf8b4e&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Thingino Web UI&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;supported-hardware&#34;&gt;Supported Hardware
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please find &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/supported_hardware.md&#34; &gt;the full list of supported cameras&lt;/a&gt;
in a separate document. Visit &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://thingino.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our website&lt;/a&gt; for an illustrated version of
the list.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;building&#34;&gt;Building
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/themactep/thingino-firmware
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;cd thingino-firmware
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;make
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/themactep/thingino-firmware/wiki/Building-from-sources&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Building from sources&lt;/a&gt; article for more info.&lt;/p&gt;
